# Adapted from Polestar's guide forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas (GPL-3.0, github.com/fitzforge/polestar, tag v0.3.4).
# Changes: guide id, title, folder, next guide, group notes. Quest steps kept as Polestar wrote them,
# except where a comment marked "Groupe Alliance" says otherwise.
guide groupe-alliance/22-feralas
title Group 20 · Feralas
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 43-45
zone Feralas
next groupe-alliance/23-tanaris

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Rise of the Silithid (4267).
# Left out: Lonebrow's Journal (1100), The Giant Guardian (2844), Wandering Shay (2845).

step Into The Barrens
  zone The Barrens
  note Everyone at their own pace: what you already did ticks itself, the guide picks up where you are. Playing together? Group XP is best within 4 levels.
  goto 49.5,78.4 "Into The Barrens"

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Razorfen Downs, optional (asked in Stormwind in Group 18, `when group
# 3636`): its entrance (Barrens 49,93.9, Dungeons codex) sits east of the road to the Great Lift.
# Quests, givers, objectives and prerequisites from Polestar's Forever data, cross-checked with
# the TrinityCore base (3525 after 3523) and Warcraft Tavern's Forever quest guide (12/11/2026:
# Myriam on a hill outside, her three targets outside the portal, Belnistrasz in a prison cell
# inside, neither of his quests shareable, Bring the Light not shareable). The dungeon's own XP is
# low at 43-44; its four quests pay about 12,000 XP. Not played in game.
step Razorfen Downs (dungeon, optional)
  label rfd-start
  when group 3636
  when level<46
  zone The Barrens
  tip Razorfen Downs: a 5-player dungeon at the southern edge of the Barrens, levels 35 to 41, east of the road down to the Great Lift. At 43 or so it goes fast. Myriam Moonsinger waits on a hill outside it. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on to Feralas.
  note In the quest log before going in: Bring the Light (Archbishop Benedictus, Stormwind, Group 18). Myriam's quest is taken here; Belnistrasz's two inside. Keep 3 free quest log slots.
  accept 6626                         -- Myriam Moonsinger, on a hill outside

step Razorfen Downs: outside the portal
  when group 3636
  when done rfd-start
  tip The three targets of A Host of Evil live outside the portal, among the barrows and thorns (elites, 33).
  kill 7873 x8 quest 6626 @47.2,89.6  -- Razorfen Battleguard
  kill 7874 x8 quest 6626 @47.2,91.5  -- Razorfen Thornweaver
  kill 7872 x8 quest 6626 @47.3,90.3  -- Death's Head Cultist
  turnin 6626                         -- Myriam Moonsinger

step Razorfen Downs: Belnistrasz
  when group 3636
  when done rfd-start
  tip Belnistrasz waits in a prison cell inside. His quests cannot be shared: every player takes Scourge of the Downs and hands it in to him (he wants his Oathstone back) BEFORE anyone starts Extinguishing the Idol. Then he walks to the idol and casts while waves of enemies come: stay close and keep them off him; it ends at his brazier.
  accept 3523                         -- Belnistrasz
  turnin 3523
  accept 3525
  complete 3525                       -- Protect him at the idol
  turnin 3525 object 152097           -- Belnistrasz's Brazier

step Razorfen Downs: Amnennar the Coldbringer
  when group 3636
  when done rfd-start
  tip The last boss (elite 41), at the far end.
  kill 7358 quest 3636                -- Amnennar the Coldbringer

step The Barrens
  zone The Barrens
  goto 44.0,93.0 "The Barrens"

step Thalanaar flight master
  zone Feralas
  goto 89.5,45.9 "Thalanaar flight master"
  getfp "Thalanaar"

step Boat to Feathermoon Stronghold
  zone Feralas
  goto 43.3,42.7 "Boat to Feathermoon Stronghold"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feathermoon

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Feathermoon Stronghold stands on Sardor Isle, off the Forgotten Coast: the boat from the coast's dock crosses to it. Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  getfp "Feathermoon" npc 8019        -- Fyldren Moonfeather
  accept 2821                         -- Pratt McGrubben
  accept 2866                         -- Shandris Feathermoon, beside him
  sethome "Feathermoon Stronghold" npc 7736 -- Innkeeper Shyria
  accept 4124                         -- Latronicus Moonspear, at the top of the stronghold
  turnin 4124                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4125
  accept 2939                         -- Troyas Moonbreeze: his answer waits in Rut'theran Village, later
  accept 2982                         -- Angelas Moonbreeze

step Ruins of Solarsal
  tip Walk south along the island to the naga ruins; the gazebo stands among them.
  turnin 2866                         -- Solarsal Gazebo
  accept 2867

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  turnin 2867                         -- Shandris Feathermoon
  accept 3130
  turnin 3130                         -- Latronicus Moonspear
  accept 2869

step Hatecrest naga
  tip Back to the Ruins of Solarsal. Every Hatecrest naga there can drop scales.
  collect 9247 quest 2869             -- Hatecrest Naga Scale

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  turnin 2869                         -- Latronicus Moonspear
  accept 2870
  note Lord Shalzaru waits for the end of the mainland loop.

step Boat to The Forgotten Coast
  zone Feralas
  goto 31.0,39.8 "Boat to The Forgotten Coast"

step Feralas
  zone Feralas
  goto 45.4,65.0 "Feralas"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The southern mainland

step The courier's boat
  tip Take the boat to the Forgotten Coast and follow the shore south to the wrecked row boat on the beach.
  turnin 4125                         -- Wrecked Row Boat
  accept 4127

step Gordunni ogres
  tip Ride east to the Gordunni camp in the hills south-east of the yeti valley: Warlocks and Shaman hold the camp, Brutes wander the slopes around it and further north.
  kill 5236 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Shaman
  kill 5232 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Brute
  kill 5240 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Warlock

step Feral Scar Vale
  tip Ride north into the yeti valley. Every Feral Scar yeti can drop a thick hide; Bloodroar the Stalker (level 48) prowls the middle.
  collect 8973 quest 2821             -- Thick Yeti Hide

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  turnin 4127                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4129
  turnin 2821                         -- Pratt McGrubben
  accept 7733
  turnin 4129                         -- Quintis Jonespyre, upstairs
  accept 4130
  turnin 4130                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4131
  turnin 2982                         -- Angelas Moonbreeze

step Boat to The Forgotten Coast
  zone Feralas
  goto 31.0,39.8 "Boat to The Forgotten Coast"

step Feralas
  zone Feralas
  goto 28.5,70.5 "Feralas"

step Isle of Dread
  tip The Isle of Dread is the island just south of Sardor Isle: swim over. Hatecrest Serpent Guards and Sorceresses hold it; Lord Shalzaru (level 47) waits in the cave at its south end. Pull his guards first.
  collect 9248 quest 2870 @28.5,70.5 map 1444 -- Mysterious Relic; below ground

step Boat to Feathermoon Stronghold
  zone Feralas
  goto 43.3,42.7 "Boat to Feathermoon Stronghold"

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  turnin 2870                         -- Latronicus Moonspear
  accept 2871
  turnin 2871                         -- Vestia Moonspear

step Fly to Thalanaar
  zone Feralas
  goto 30.3,43.3 "Feathermoon flight master"
  fly "Thalanaar"

step Feralas
  zone Feralas
  goto 65.9,45.7 "Feralas"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The eastern loop

step Grimtotem camp
  tip Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east across Feralas to the Grimtotem camp north of the road. Kindal Moonweaver waits outside it; free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the middle and keep Kindal and at least six of them alive.
  accept 2969                         -- Kindal Moonweaver
  complete 2969
  turnin 2969
  accept 2970                         -- Jer'kai Moonweaver

step Grimtotem tauren
  kill 7726 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Naturalist
  kill 7725 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Raider
  kill 7727 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Shaman

step Jer'kai Moonweaver
  turnin 2970
  accept 2972                         -- for Tyrande in Darnassus: the route takes you there at 47

step The Writhing Deep
  tip Ride south-east to the Woodpaw gnolls; the courier's backpacks lie in their southern camp, and a parcel inside them starts a delivery to Thalanaar. The Zukk'ash hive is just south: fight down to the pod that holds Raschal, free him and keep him alive on the way out.
  turnin 4131                         -- Large Leather Backpacks
  accept 4135
  collect 11463                       -- Undelivered Parcel, from the backpacks
  accept 4281
  turnin 4135                         -- Zukk'ash Pod, inside
  accept 4265
  complete 4265

step High Wilderness: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip Ride back west along the road, then north into the Rage Scar hills. Every yeti here can drop a hide; one may drop a Pristine Yeti Hide, which Pratt pays for too.
  collect 6258 quest 1452.2 @53.2,47.3 map 1444
  collect 6259 quest 1452.3 @56.9,54.5 map 1444
  collect 18947 quest 7733            -- Rage Scar Yeti Hide

step Rage Scar Hold
  collect 18969 optional              -- Pristine Yeti Hide
  accept 7735 optional

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  turnin 4265                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4266
  turnin 4266                         -- Shandris Feathermoon
  accept 4267

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  note Shandris then asks you to carry news to Darnassus: skip it, Gadgetzan sends you there instead.
  turnin 7733                         -- Pratt McGrubben
  turnin 7735 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Level 45

step Grind to 45
  zone Feralas
  tip Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east into Feral Scar Vale. Zorbin's quests on the coast need level 45.
  level 45 -- grind on Feral Scar Yeti at Feral Scar Vale, Feralas

step Boat to The Forgotten Coast
  zone Feralas
  goto 31.0,39.8 "Boat to The Forgotten Coast"

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Ride back to the Forgotten Coast; the goblin stands by the dock.
  accept 7003
  accept 7721

step The Forgotten Coast: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip Shore Striders, Deep Striders and Wave Striders (elite giants) wade along the coast north of the dock: zap one with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker and kill the shrunken giant. Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays drift in the same surf.
  collect 18958 quest 7721            -- Water Elemental Core
  collect 18956 quest 7003            -- Miniaturization Residue
  use 18904 quest 7003.1 @44.3,46.6 map 1444

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  turnin 7003
  turnin 7721
  note Zorbin's refills are level 55: skip them.
  note You end at the Forgotten Coast dock: the Tanaris guide starts with the trip east from here.

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Maraudon, optional, asked here (`when group 7065`) at level 45, the level
# Corruption of Earth and Seed needs (Grind to 45 just before). The way: boat to Feathermoon, flight
# to Nijel's Point (Talendria, Keeper Marandis), south to Kormek's Hut (Willow), south-west to the
# caves of Maraudon (Cavindra), and back the same way; then the flight to Thalanaar, where this
# guide ends. Givers, levels, objectives, drops and places outside the instance: Polestar's Forever
# data and Dungeons codex (data-v2026.11.1); prerequisites: none but 7046 after 7044 (Polestar and
# the TrinityCore base agree). Inside, the orange side (Noxxion, the vines), the purple side (Lord
# Vyletongue), then the inner part (Celebras, Princess Theradras): Warcraft Tavern's Forever
# Maraudon quest guide (12/11/2026), itself from Classic (closed in the Forever beta): to check in
# game. Shareable: Willow's, Cavindra's, Marandis's and Tervosh's quests; not Talendria's, not
# Celebras's. Left out: The Pariah's Instructions (five centaur khans all over Desolace).
step Maraudon (dungeon, optional)
  label mara-start
  when group 7065
  zone Feralas
  tip Maraudon: the caves of the centaurs' sacred ground in western Desolace, levels 42 to 51, a long dungeon (two wings, then the inner part, whose last boss is 51). At 45 it takes a solid group of 5. From here: the boat to Feathermoon Stronghold, the flight to Nijel's Point, about ten minutes' ride to the dungeon, and the same way back; the guide then flies on to Thalanaar. Alone? Skip it.
  note Three quests at Nijel's Point and Kormek's Hut on the way, one at the dungeon's door. Keep 6 free quest log slots.
  goto 43.3,42.7 "Boat to Feathermoon Stronghold"

step Maraudon: fly to Nijel's Point
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  zone Feralas
  goto 30.3,43.3 "Feathermoon flight master"
  fly "Nijel's Point"
  zone Desolace

step Maraudon: Nijel's Point
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  zone Desolace
  tip Talendria and Keeper Marandis stand in the night elf outpost. Talendria's quest cannot be shared: each player takes it here, with its Coated Cerulean Vial.
  accept 7041                         -- Talendria
  accept 7065                         -- Keeper Marandis

step Maraudon: Willow
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  tip Ride south along the road to Kormek's Hut, by Thunder Axe Fortress: Willow waits there.
  accept 7028                         -- Willow

step Maraudon: before going in
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  tip Ride south-west to the Valley of Spears: the caves of Maraudon open in the hills west of it. Cavindra waits in the first cave. Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at an orange crystal pool, outside the orange portal (the right-hand path where the caves split); the blue water does not count.
  note In the quest log before going in: Vyletongue Corruption and Corruption of Earth and Seed (Nijel's Point), Twisted Evils (Willow), Legends of Maraudon (Cavindra, here). If you took it: Shadowshard Fragments (Archmage Tervosh, Theramore, Group 18): the Shadowshard Rumblers and Smashers (elite) roam the slopes north of the caves. Not on this route: The Pariah's Instructions (the centaur pariah of southern Desolace sends you after five khans).
  accept 7044                         -- Cavindra
  collect 17696 quest 7041 @33.2,65.7 -- Filled Cerulean Vial: the orange crystal pool
  collect 17756 x10 quest 7070 optional @27.6,56.2 -- Shadowshard Fragment: Shadowshard Rumblers and Smashers
  goto 29.1,62.5 "Maraudon" r 25

step Maraudon: along the way
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  along until mara-end
  tip Collected all through the dungeon: the Theradric Crystal Carvings, from the centaurs, satyrs and dryads and from most bosses. Every player with the quest loots their own.
  note Share Twisted Evils, Corruption of Earth and Seed and Legends of Maraudon with your group: click each in the quest log, then Share.
  collect 17684 x15 quest 7028        -- Theradric Crystal Carving

step Maraudon: the orange side
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  tip On the orange side, by the Vylestem Vines: use the Filled Cerulean Vial near one, a Noxxious Scion comes out (45, immune to Nature); kill it to heal the vine, 8 times. Noxxion, at the end of this side, drops the Celebrian Rod.
  kill 13696 x8 quest 7041            -- Noxxious Scion: one per vine
  collect 17702 quest 7044            -- Celebrian Rod: Noxxion

step Maraudon: the purple side
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  tip Back out and in through the purple portal: Lord Vyletongue, at the end of this side, drops the Celebrian Diamond.
  collect 17703 quest 7044            -- Celebrian Diamond: Lord Vyletongue

step Maraudon: Celebras
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  tip In the inner part, Celebras the Cursed: once beaten, he comes back as Celebras the Redeemed. Hand him Legends of Maraudon; his next quest cannot be shared: each player takes it, then waits while he makes the scepter and speaks with him again.
  turnin 7044                         -- Celebras the Redeemed
  accept 7046
  complete 7046
  turnin 7046

step Maraudon: Princess Theradras
  label mara-end
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  tip Princess Theradras, the last boss (51), at the far end of the inner part. Zaetar's Spirit then rises: its quest, Seed of Life, goes to Keeper Remulos in Moonglade, where the guide passes in Group 28; keep it until then.
  kill 12201 quest 7065               -- Princess Theradras
  accept 7066 optional                -- Zaetar's Spirit

step Maraudon: Willow
  when complete 7028
  zone Desolace
  tip Back north along the road: Willow at Kormek's Hut.
  turnin 7028                         -- Willow

step Maraudon: Keeper Marandis
  when complete 7065
  zone Desolace
  turnin 7065                         -- Keeper Marandis, Nijel's Point

step Maraudon: Talendria
  when complete 7041
  zone Desolace
  turnin 7041                         -- Talendria, Nijel's Point

step Maraudon: quests not done
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  tip What is left of Maraudon in the quest log cannot be finished on this route (the guide does not come back): it is dropped here. Seed of Life stays, for Moonglade.
  abandon 7028
  abandon 7065
  abandon 7041
  abandon 7044
  abandon 7046

step Maraudon: fly to Thalanaar
  when group 7065
  when done mara-start
  zone Desolace
  goto 64.7,10.5 "Nijel's Point flight master"
  fly "Thalanaar"
  zone Feralas

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Shadowshard Fragments (7070, Archmage Tervosh, Group 18, `when group 7070`),
# when not done (no Maraudon, or the fragments missed): the route does not come back.
step Shadowshard Fragments: not done
  when onquest 7070
  when !complete 7070
  tip Shadowshard Fragments needs the elementals outside Maraudon, and the guide does not come back to Desolace: abandon it.
  abandon 7070

step Thalanaar
  when onquest 4281
  tip Ride north-east to the night elf outpost on the Thousand Needles border.
  turnin 4281                         -- Falfindel Waywarder walks around Thalanaar: look inside the circle on the map